{%- comment -%}Draft-theme demo information; no store-wide policy content is created or changed.{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="six7-footer__demo-info page-width">
  <details>
    <summary>Portfolio demo information</summary>
    <p>Portfolio demonstration store. Published products use native product pages and variant availability. Size, fit and additional Color options remain unverified; zero-stock variants that disallow overselling remain sold out.</p>
    {% if shop.shipping_policy == blank or shop.refund_policy == blank or shop.terms_of_service == blank %}
      <p>Not configured for this demonstration:
        {% if shop.shipping_policy == blank %}shipping policy{% endif %}{% if shop.refund_policy == blank %}{% if shop.shipping_policy == blank %}, {% endif %}refund policy{% endif %}{% if shop.terms_of_service == blank %}{% if shop.shipping_policy == blank or shop.refund_policy == blank %}, {% endif %}terms of service{% endif %}.
        This information is a portfolio note, not a legal policy or a delivery or refund commitment.
      </p>
    {% endif %}
    <p>Available variants use the standard store cart. Payment, shipping, tax and fulfillment readiness have not been verified for a real launch.</p>
  </details>
</div>
